  "goodToKnow": "Die Atomwaffe is a nuclear weapon; synonyms are Kernwaffe and Nuklearwaffe. Germany renounced its own nuclear weapons, confirmed in the 1990 reunification treaty, but under NATO's nukleare Teilhabe (nuclear sharing), US weapons are stationed at Büchel in the Eifel, and German jets could deliver them. Debates about a European nuclear deterrent have grown since 2022. Plural: die Atomwaffen."
